## 3. Information We Do Not Intentionally Collect

Unless a future feature specifically requires it and this Privacy Policy is updated accordingly, SWB Poke Monitor is not designed to collect:

- Discord passwords
- Retailer account passwords
- Credit card numbers
- Bank account information
- Social Security numbers
- Government identification numbers
- Exact home addresses
- Continuous GPS location
- Private Discord messages unrelated to App interactions
- Message content from Discord channels for advertising or behavioral profiling

SWB Poke Monitor does not require users to provide payment-card information directly to the App to receive retailer stock information.

If paid features are introduced in the future, payments may be processed by an independent payment provider. This Privacy Policy will be updated as appropriate before such functionality is introduced.

