## 4. How We Use Information

Information collected or processed by SWB Poke Monitor may be used to:

- Respond to Discord slash commands and interactions
- Search for Pokémon TCG products
- Monitor product availability
- Monitor product pricing
- Detect restocks
- Detect relevant price changes
- Provide local inventory searches
- Maintain user watchlists
- Deliver requested Discord alerts
- Deliver other enabled notifications
- Remember user and server preferences
- Prevent duplicate notifications
- Configure Discord alert channels
- Operate administrator features
- Troubleshoot application errors
- Maintain service security
- Prevent abuse
- Enforce rate limits
- Diagnose retailer/provider outages
- Improve the reliability of the App
- Comply with applicable legal obligations

We do not use Discord data obtained through the App to create advertising profiles.

