## 14. Inventory and Availability Information

SWB Poke Monitor processes product inventory information for informational and notification purposes.

Inventory information may be delayed, inaccurate, incomplete, or change before a user reaches a retailer.

An "in stock" notification does not guarantee that a product will remain available or that a retailer will fulfill an order.

SWB Poke Monitor does not process a user's retailer purchase merely because the App provides a link to a retailer.

